 "provenance": "Angkor 9 boss (w0 l8), control-only on the exact S700 core (paint-corrected engine). Start: weaponTier 1 (hammer chest of Angkor 4), maxHealth 4 (base armour, no shop armour), lives 12, 99 diamonds, 2 red diamonds (the campaign chain values on reaching Angkor 9). Route: walks in through the riddle trigger at 9,5 (gates close), steps to 10,5 to wake the boss in column 0 (x 10-11), goes round by row 4 to 13,5 and, 5 ticks into boss state 2 (mouth open at the column bottom, cGame.method_278), pushes the stone 12,5 left so it falls down x=11 onto the boss (method_273, hit 1); retreats to 9,5 (outside the column and row 4), which makes the boss pick column 0 again (method_277) while the stone respawns at 12,2 (method_280); repeats the push twice more (hits 2 and 3, no damage taken). The boss death (state 7 -> 8) calls method_327, which solves riddle room 0 and opens the gate 18,5; the hero walks to the chest at 27,6 and the crystal sequence ends the stage (gameState 28).",
